This repository contains a modified version of Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B.

Modifications by Meta Platforms, Inc.: conversion to the ExecuTorch program format (.pte) for the
ExecuTorch WebGPU backend, and quantization as described in README.md.

The original work and these modifications are distributed under the license in LICENSE.

GoldFire Dragon Browser loads this model from its own static assets. Its learned
parameters come from mlabonne/Qwen3-0.6B-abliterated, revision
41f8d678c35975a24212ba092993ac034e2fccdc, quantized with PyTorch in groups of
64. The ExecuTorch graph comes from executorch-community/Qwen3-0.6B-ExecuTorch-WebGPU
at revision 65fa8ec0b8996b4a0157cdb89ea766b000b1134a. The browser uses 2048
KV positions. The tokenizer accompanies the abliterated PyTorch checkpoint.

The final decoder block also incorporates a GoldFire Korean dialogue adaptation trained with PyTorch.
